e allowance for the caller of at least `subtractedValue`."},"increaseAllowance(address,uint256)":{"details":"Atomically increases the allowance granted to `spender` by the caller. This is an alternative to {approve} that can be used as a mitigation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. Requirements: - `spender` cannot be the zero address."},"isMinter(address)":{"params":{"account":"Account to query."},"returns":{"status":"True if `account` can mint, false otherwise."}},"mint(address,uint256)":{"params":{"account":"The receiver of new tokens.","amount":"The number of new tokens."}},"name()":{"details":"Returns the name of the token."},"nonces(address)":{"details":"See {IERC20Permit-nonces}."},"permit(address,address,uint256,uint256,uint8,bytes32,bytes32)":{"details":"See {IERC20Permit-permit}."},"removeMinter(address)":{"params":{"minter":"The minter to remove."}},"setPendingGovernance(address)":{"params":{"pendingGovernance_":"The new governor."}},"symbol()":{"details":"Returns the symbol of the token, usually a shorter version of the name."},"totalSupply()":{"details":"See {IERC20-totalSupply}."},"transfer(address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transfer}. Requirements: - `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - the caller must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20}. Requirements: - `sender` and `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - `sender` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for ``sender``'s tokens of at least `amount`."}},"title":"Solace Token (SOLACE)","version":1},"userdoc":{"events":{"GovernanceLocked()":{"notice":"Emitted when Governance is locked."},"GovernancePending(address)":{"notice":"Emitted when pending Governance is set."},"GovernanceTransferred(address,address)":{"notice":"Emitted when Governance is set."},"MinterAdded(address)":{"notice":"Emitted when a minter is added."},"MinterRemoved(address)":{"notice":"Emitted when a minter is removed."}},"kind":"user","methods":{"acceptGovernance()":{"notice":"Accepts the governance role. Can only be called by the pending governor."},"addMinter(address)":{"notice":"Adds a new minter. Can only be called by the current [**governor**](/docs/protocol/governance)."},"burn(uint256)":{"notice":"Burns **SOLACE** from msg.sender."},"constructor":{"notice":"Constructs the Solace Token contract."},"governance()":{"notice":"Address of the current governor."},"governanceIsLocked()":{"notice":"Returns true if governance is locked."},"isMinter(address)":{"notice":"Returns true if `account` is authorized to mint **SOLACE**."},"lockGovernance()":{"notice":"Permanently locks this contract's governance role and any of its functions that require the role. This action cannot be reversed. Before you call it, ask yourself:   - Is the contract self-sustaining?   - Is there a chance you will need governance privileges in the future? Can only be called by the current [**governor**](/docs/protocol/governance)."},"mint(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Mints new **SOLACE** to the receiver account. Can only be called by authorized minters."},"pendingGovernance()":{"notice":"Address of the governor to take over."},"removeMinter(address)":{"notice":"Removes a minter. Can only be called by the current [**governor**](/docs/protocol/governance)."},"setPendingGovernance(address)":{"notice":"Initiates transfer of the governance role to a new governor. Transfer is not complete until the new governor accepts the role. Can only be called by the current [**governor**](/docs/protocol/governance)."}},"notice":"**Solace** tokens can be earned by depositing **Capital Provider** or **Liquidity Provider** tokens to the [`Master`](./Master) contract. **SOLACE** can also be locked for a preset time in t